/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 60 0 R
/E (developed. Organizations today face increasing pressure to deliver applications quickly while maintaining quality, security, and scalability. Traditionally, software applications have been developed through manual coding using programming languages such as Java, Python, C#, and JavaScript. Although this approach offers complete control over application design and functionality, it requires significant time, skilled developers, and financial resources. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
