<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 60 0 R
/E (These platforms enable developers and even non-technical users to create applications using visual interfaces, drag-and-drop components, and pre-built modules with minimal manual coding. Low-code development significantly reduces development time and enables organizations to respond quickly to changing business needs. )
/Pg 10 0 R
